  "translation": "My friend and I went to the market together. This market is very big. We first looked at the fruit. She can choose fruit. The friend asked the boss how much the apples cost per jin. The boss said three yuan per jin. The friend bought three apples, and I also bought two. The friend asked what else we needed to buy. I said let's buy some tomatoes. Then we went to the vegetable shop. There were many vegetables in the shop. We often come to this vegetable shop. The friend asked how much the tomatoes cost per jin. The boss said five yuan per jin. We thought it was too expensive, so we didn't buy. Finally we bought half a jin of meat, then went home from the market and made dinner together. I cooked, the friend washed dishes, and we were all very happy."
